{%- comment -%}
  Free-shipping progress bar.

  Renders nothing when the cart is empty. On the product page (no cart context
  for a not-yet-added item) it previews the bar as if the current cart plus one
  unit of the selected variant were in it, so shoppers can see how close this
  purchase gets them.

  The threshold below is the single source of truth for this bar. It is written
  in the shop currency subunit, which is what `cart.total_price` returns.
  Shopify stores yen multiplied by 100, so 3,000 yen is 300000. Verified against
  a 3,500 yen product, which reports a price of 350000.

  Keep this figure in step with:
    - the announcement bar in sections/header-group.json
    - the 配送情報 tab in templates/product.json
    - the FAQ row in templates/index.json
    - the shipping rules in Settings > Shipping and delivery

  Accepts:
  - preview_price: {Number} extra amount (in the same subunit) to add on top of
    the cart total, used on the product page to preview the selected variant. (optional)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign free_shipping_threshold = 300000
  assign preview_price = preview_price | default: 0
  assign projected_total = cart.total_price | plus: preview_price

  assign remaining = free_shipping_threshold | minus: projected_total
  assign percent = 0
  if free_shipping_threshold > 0
    assign percent = projected_total | times: 100 | divided_by: free_shipping_threshold
  endif
  if percent > 100
    assign percent = 100
  endif

  assign should_render = false
  if preview_price > 0 or cart != empty
    assign should_render = true
  endif
-%}

{%- if should_render and free_shipping_threshold > 0 -%}
  <div class="free-ship{% if remaining <= 0 %} free-ship--reached{% endif %}">
    <p class="free-ship__text">
      {%- if remaining > 0 -%}
        あと<span class="free-ship__amount">{{ remaining | money }}</span>で全国送料無料
      {%- else -%}
        <span class="free-ship__check" aria-hidden="true">
          {{- 'icon-checkmark.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
        </span>
        全国送料無料でお届けします
      {%- endif -%}
    </p>
    <div class="free-ship__track-wrapper">
      <span
        class="free-ship__truck"
        aria-hidden="true"
        style="inset-inline-start: {{ percent }}%"
      >
        {{- 'icon-truck.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
      </span>
      <div
        class="free-ship__track"
        role="progressbar"
        aria-valuemin="0"
        aria-valuemax="100"
        aria-valuenow="{{ percent }}"
        {% if remaining > 0 %}
          aria-valuetext="送料無料まであと{{ remaining | money }}"
        {% else %}
          aria-valuetext="送料無料の条件を満たしています"
        {% endif %}
      >
        <span class="free-ship__fill" style="inline-size: {{ percent }}%"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
